#N Snark
#O Mike Playle, 2013
#C explanation: A still life that turns a passing glider through ninety degrees and is
#C explanation: back in its original state 43 generations later, ready for the next one.
#C explanation: Stable reflectors had been hunted since the 1970s and the known ones were
#C explanation: large or slow; this one is small, fast, and needs no clock of its own.
#C explanation: Feeding a glider around a loop of them yields an oscillator of any period
#C explanation: from 43 upwards, which is how several long-missing periods were finally
#C explanation: filled in.
#C category: misc
#C board: 45x45
#C boundary: fixed
#C frame_range: head
#C generations: 150
